]\n\"and the light...\" [short pause] [soft and mysterious]\n\"though pure...\" [short pause]\n\"cannot exist without the shadow within.” [mysterious, low, and fading]\n\nThank you for your consideration!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ichienyade/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "voice", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3547118, "client_id": 3723341, "vtt_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/1268be8a-ac47-4de0-825b-20f553b9653a?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1774613284&Signature=HIZulhxuYKiwejwcGdcR37~WtJ-Dn0kJyplyJjrMSIWkO0-5PSV6DH1EwxvpyKf92BJPTvs-SUepfx2H-BQZfRNGxGp4ypIikuFj-rcjvJ3h3npk6-Ajnh6dYYonj5pbrovK4EFdbEt40X2kwUDwj3n3EmEYtt71ZsKBykZWBJzofeId0WAQB~-J7KDsCgTun6-T498t3sdjVnMxaRY5M72Rzcq9k3ffg1JOwM0tjxeJT6fTY5kdLBdvwLyqjaD2IbVaQliuX~qEEcV9g5NJS4LSxCCYF3s~KV01y7LyGn-7GrxWTnlOk19fwmm8ZDtPwqTVslR90SIzkShPHVIcxw__&Key-Pair-Id=K1GS3H53SEO647", "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1964992487837298688%2F6DG0F8_z.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=717d0cc6322256ee8f75c1334bfe016d", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1964992487837298688%2F6DG0F8_z.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=717d0cc6322256ee8f75c1334bfe016d, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1964992487837298688%2F6DG0F8_z.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5da5174bddb05cc24f5dc12461c4539e 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1964992487837298688%2F6DG0F8_z.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df520b5ee123c00ffa0a3857d223feb3 3x"}, "preview_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/8fc06be3-8559-4d